#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:40
#. Tag: refpurpose
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rebuilds the KService desktop file system configuration cache"
msgstr "KService डेस्कटॉप् सञ्चिकातन्त्रविन्याससञ्चयस्य पुनर्निर्माणं करोति"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:44
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "सार"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:46
#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kbuildsycoca6</command> <group choice=\"opt\" "
"rep=\"repeat\"><replaceable class=\"option\">OPTIONS</replaceable></group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kbuildsycoca6</command> <group choice=\"opt\" "
"rep=\"repeat\"><replaceable class=\"option\">विकल्पाः</replaceable></group> "
"इति"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:56
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:58
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kbuildsycoca6</command> builds binary cache of the data stored in "
"<literal role=\"extension\">.desktop</literal> and &MIME; type <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.xml</literal> files that the KService framework uses to "
"find plugins, applications and other services."
msgstr ""
"<command>kbuildsycoca6</command> <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.desktop</literal> इत्यत्र संगृहीतदत्तांशस्य "
"द्विचक्रीयसञ्चयं निर्माति तथा च &MIME; <literal "
"role=\"extension\">.xml</literal> सञ्चिकाः टङ्कयन्तु येषां उपयोगं "
"KService-रूपरेखा प्लगिन्स्, अनुप्रयोगाः अन्यसेवाः च अन्वेष्टुं करोति ।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:65
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KService library uses this database to efficiently provide the "
"information requested of it."
msgstr ""
"KService पुस्तकालयः अस्य दत्तांशकोशस्य उपयोगं कृत्वा तस्य अनुरोधितसूचनाः "
"कुशलतया प्रदातुं शक्नोति ।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:70
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Users do not normally need to run this application directly; KService will "
"run it if necessary, when any of the files whose data is cached are changed."
msgstr ""
"उपयोक्तृभ्यः सामान्यतया एतत् अनुप्रयोगं प्रत्यक्षतया चालयितुं आवश्यकता "
"नास्ति; KService आवश्यके सति तत् चालयिष्यति, यदा येषां सञ्चिकानां दत्तांशः "
"संग्रहीतः अस्ति तेषु कापि परिवर्तनं भवति ।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:79
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "विकल्पाः"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:83
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--global"
msgstr "--वैश्विक"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:85
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ignores any user-set files (in <varname>XDG_DATA_HOME</varname>). This is "
"currently only supported on &UNIX; systems."
msgstr ""
"कस्यापि उपयोक्तृ-समूहस्य सञ्चिकायाः (<varname>XDG_DATA_HOME</varname> "
"इत्यत्र) अवहेलनां करोति । इदं सम्प्रति केवलं &UNIX; प्रणाल्याः ।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:90
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--noincremental"
msgstr "--अवृद्धि"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:92
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rather than using the existing cache and only updating the information that "
"has changed or been added, start with an empty cache. Ignored if "
"<option>--global</option> is set."
msgstr ""
"विद्यमानसञ्चयस्य उपयोगेन केवलं परिवर्तितां वा योजितां वा सूचनां "
"अद्यतनीकर्तुं न अपि तु रिक्तसञ्चयेन आरभत । उपेक्षितम् यदि<option "
"value=--global> --वैश्विक</option> सेट् भवति।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:97
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--menutest"
msgstr "-- मेनू परीक्षण"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:99
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Test the generation of the application menu database. Does not actually "
"build the cache."
msgstr ""
"अनुप्रयोगमेनूदत्तांशकोशस्य जननस्य परीक्षणं कुर्वन्तु। वस्तुतः सञ्चयं न "
"निर्माति ।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:104
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--testmode"
msgstr "--परीक्षाविधिः"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:106
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the QStandardPaths \"test mode\" to avoid interfering with user data. "
"This is intended for use with unit tests."
msgstr ""
"उपयोक्तृदत्तांशस्य हस्तक्षेपं परिहरितुं QStandardPaths \"test mode\" "
"इत्यस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु । एतत् एककपरीक्षाभिः सह उपयोगाय अभिप्रेतम् अस्ति ।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:111
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--track <replaceable>menu-id</replaceable>"
msgstr "--track <प्रतिस्थापनीय>मेनू-id</replaceable>"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:113
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Track a menu ID for debugging."
msgstr "त्रुटिनिवारणार्थं मेनू-ID अनुसरणं कुर्वन्तु ।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:118
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--author"
msgstr "--लेखकः"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:120
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show author information."
msgstr "लेखकसूचना दर्शयतु।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:127
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "--license"
msgstr "--अनुज्ञापत्रम्"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:129
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show license information."
msgstr "अनुज्ञापत्रसूचना दर्शयतु।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:136
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "-h, --help"
msgstr "-ह, --सहाय"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:138
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show a brief help text."
msgstr "संक्षिप्तं सहायतापाठं दर्शयतु।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:145
#. Tag: option
#, no-c-format
msgid "-v , --version"
msgstr "-व , --संस्करणम्"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:147
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show version information."
msgstr "संस्करणसूचना दर्शयतु।"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:159
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Files"
msgstr "सञ्चिकाः"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:162
#. Tag: filename
#, no-c-format
msgid "<varname>cachedir</varname>/ksycoca6_[lang]_[sha1-of-dirs]"
msgstr "<varname>cachedir</varname>/क्सायकोका6_[लङ्ग]_[शा1-ऑफ-दिर्स]"

#: man-kbuildsycoca6.8.docbook:164
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KService cache generated by <command>kbuildsycoca6</command>. On &UNIX; "
"systems, <varname>cachedir</varname> is typically <filename "
"class=\"directory\"><envar>XDG_CACHE_HOME</envar></filename>."
msgstr ""
"<command>kbuildsycoca6</command> द्वारा उत्पन्नं KService-सञ्चयं । &UNIX; "
"प्रणालीषु, <varname>cachedir</varname> सामान्यतया <filename "
"class=\"directory\"><envar>XDG_CACHE_HOME</envar></filename> अस्ति ।"

